    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow takes a chunk off the heel of your footwear, punching your foot sideways and making you stagger.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You need to pass an <strong>Easy (+40) Athletics</strong> Test or gain @Condition[Prone]. Also, your shoe/boot/whatever may need repair. If you were barefoot, lose one extra Wound as the bullet grazes your sole. </p><p>No Extraction is necessary.</p>"
